## About

Penumbra Forge LLC is a one-person software studio maintaining mostly small utilities and a few larger projects. Many site utilities are client-side and the website source is visible under its repository license; separately licensed open-source projects include Gate, vexes, and mcp-librarian. AI features can run in the browser with WebGPU, send requests to a user-configured local or remote OpenAI-compatible endpoint, or use non-model logic depending on the page. The active route determines where input goes. Umbra is a working private Apple Silicon/MLX prototype with no public build or supported release: https://penumbraforge.com/umbra/
